Package: pubdeck
Title: House Figure Theme and PowerPoint Deck Builder for Routine Reports
Version: 0.3.3
Authors@R:
    person("Mohamed A.", "Yusuf", , "mohamedayusuf87@gmail.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-9339-4613"))
Description: Provides a 'ggplot2' theme, colour palettes, figure and table
    savers, and helpers that assemble a 'PowerPoint' deck from a template
    with 'officer'. Slide geometry is read from the template, and the
    styling and wording a deck uses are held in one configuration object,
    so several reporting pipelines can share one look and one set of page
    builders.
